OL,3,GNEWSARail route to close in half term
OL,4,Afor 'essential' works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rail route linking Surrey and
OL,7,FBerkshire will be shut for seven days
OL,8,Ffor "essential track and bridge
OL,9,Fmaintenance work" to be carried out.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said no trains will run
OL,12,Fbetween Staines and Windsor & Eton
OL,13,FRiverside between 26 October and 1
OL,14,FNovember, affecting South Western
OL,15,FRailway (SWR) services.
OL,17,FDuring the closure, work will take
OL,18,Fplace on the stretch of track and at
OL,19,Ftwo bridges, to improve the railway's
OL,20,F"reliability and resilience", said the
OL,21,Frail infrastructure manager.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
